# `escape_interpolation` is external: inside an f-string, `{{` is a literal
# brace and `{n}` is code. Both spellings appear here and they must not be
# confused - two escapes, one interpolation, and the interpolation holds an
# identifier while the escapes hold nothing.
roots 1
mends 0
holds escape_interpolation
spans escape_interpolation 6 8
spans escape_interpolation 13 15
holds interpolation
spans interpolation 16 19
